'''Lt. Surge''' (Japanese: '''マチス''' ''Matisse'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Move all {{e|Lightning}} Energy from your Benched Pokémon to your {{TCGP|Raichu}}, {{TCGP|Electrode}}, or {{TCGP|Electabuzz}} in the Active Spot.
}}

