==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Lt. Surge}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Lt. Surge]] is a [[Gym Leader]] in [[Kanto]]. The interior of the [[Vermilion Gym]], as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}, is featured in the regular print's illustration.

